  - nodeId: er_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "29 wrze\u015Bnia 2008. Dwa tygodnie temu w Ameryce upad\u0142 bank, kt\xF3rego nazwy nikt w kuchni nie umia\u0142 wym\xF3wi\u0107. Dzi\u015B radio m\xF3wi ju\u017C tylko o irlandzkich bankach i o tym, jak lec\u0105 ich akcje."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch4_with_gavin
    branchNodeId: er_glass
    nextNodeId: er_old
  - nodeId: er_glass
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Szklana restauracja nad Liffey, poniedzia\u0142ek, \xF3sma wieczorem. Dwa stoliki zaj\u0119te. Deweloper w r\xF3\u017Cowej koszuli nie zap\u0142aci\u0142 rachunku z sierpnia: trzy tysi\u0105ce euro."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Glass walls, Kooba. The whole city can see there's nobody inside. The bank rang. We close on Friday. Half my lads will be on the dole by Christmas.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Szklane \u015Bciany. My\u015Bla\u0142em, \u017Ce s\u0105 dla widowni. Teraz widownia patrzy na pust\u0105 sal\u0119."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - glass
    - nobody
    - inside
    - close
    - friday
    - christmas
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_dole
    setFlags:
    - ch5_glass_closed
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: er_end
  - nodeId: er_old
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Stara restauracja Declana, poniedzia\u0142ek, \xF3sma wieczorem. P\xF3\u0142 sali pustej. Szklana, nad Liffey, stoi zamkni\u0119ta od tygodnia, z kartk\u0105 od banku na drzwiach."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: It's fierce quiet. Remember what I told you? Nothing in this country lasts. I hate being right, Kooba.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - quiet
    - remember
    - hate
    - right
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_fierce
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: er_end
  - nodeId: er_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "W kuchni cicho. Nawet zmywarka szumi jakby ciszej, \u017Ceby nie zwraca\u0107 na siebie uwagi."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Zostaj\u0119 po zamkni\u0119ciu i myj\u0119 wszystko jeszcze raz, za darmo."
      targetNodeId: er_stay
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Id\u0119 do domu wcze\u015Bniej. Nie ma co robi\u0107."
      targetNodeId: er_home
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: er_stay
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Myj\u0119 czyste talerze. G\u0142upie? Mo\u017Ce. Ale dop\xF3ki co\u015B myj\u0119, ta kuchnia jeszcze dzia\u0142a."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch5_stayed_late
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: -10
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: er_home
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Pierwszy raz od czterech lat wychodz\u0119 przed p\xF3\u0142noc\u0105. Dublin o dziesi\u0105tej wieczorem wygl\u0105da jak miasto, w kt\xF3rym kto\u015B wy\u0142\u0105czy\u0142 muzyk\u0119."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
